  - speaker: Devil
    text: "You\u2019ve already finished your thesis\u2026?"
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Player
    text: "I\u2019m done, so let me graduate."
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Devil
    text: "Hahahaha!  \r\nYou think writing your thesis is all it takes?"
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Devil
    text: "Even after you submit it, \nthere are still plenty of hurdles to get through!"
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Player
    text: "That's my problem. \nNow let me out."
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Devil
    text: Heh. Did you really think I'd let you go that easily?
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Devil
    text: "I\u2019m the final step."
    requiresName: 0
    shakeCamera: 0
    changeDevilSpriteOnEnd: 0
    devilSpriteOnEnd: {fileID: 0}
    weakShake: 0
  - speaker: Devil
    text: 'You will not graduate

      unless you defeat me!!!!'
